@startuml
hide footbox
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
participant "Customer App" as P0
participant "FoodOrder API / Service" as P1
participant "Repositories / Database" as P2
participant "Merchant Portal" as P3
participant "Kafka Broker" as P4
== Create order [CASH; valid request] ==
P0 -> P1 : POST /api/v1/food-orders
P1 -> P2 : Load restaurant and menu items
P2 --> P1 : Restaurant and menu data
P1 -> P1 : Check OPEN, unlocked, items available
P1 -> P1 : Calculate item totals and delivery fee
P1 -> P2 : Save FoodOrder (PENDING) + FoodOrderItem
P1 --> P0 : 201 Created: ApiResponse<FoodOrderResponse>
loop Auto-refresh enabled: every 5 s
P3 -> P1 : GET /api/v1/food-orders/restaurant/{restaurantId}
P1 -> P2 : Check owner; load restaurant orders
P1 --> P3 : 200 OK: orders excluding AWAITING_PAYMENT
end
== Restaurant accepts and prepares the order ==
P3 -> P1 : PATCH /api/v1/food-orders/{orderId}/status: ACCEPTED
P1 -> P1 : Redis lock; check owner and current status
P1 -> P2 : Save PENDING → ACCEPTED
P1 --> P3 : 200 OK: updated order; release lock
P3 -> P1 : PATCH /api/v1/food-orders/{orderId}/status: PREPARING
P1 -> P1 : Redis lock; check owner and current status
P1 -> P2 : Save ACCEPTED → PREPARING
P1 --> P3 : 200 OK: updated order; release lock
opt Restaurant marks order ready for pickup
P3 -> P1 : PATCH /api/v1/food-orders/{orderId}/status: READY_FOR_PICKUP
P1 -> P2 : Validate and save READY_FOR_PICKUP
P1 -> P4 : Publish FIND_DRIVER_FOR_FOOD_ORDER
P1 --> P3 : 200 OK: updated order
end
@enduml
